vci-ephemeral (0.1.5) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Add ${misc:Depends} to every binary package: dh-vci adds
    deb-vci-helper there, which the maintainer scripts call; without it apt
    could remove deb-vci-helper first and the prerm failed.

